WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,280
Just because they are children

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,480
So we need more education

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,880
In my third year of junior high school, I carried my Jiaojiao costume bag to school.

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,880
You guys have even changed the family law.

5
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:12,860
can you hate me

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,260
Which ear did you hear me saying that I hate you?

7
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,340
I mean

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,540
you did something wrong

9
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:21,740
It’s enough to accept criticism and education, Mu Ye

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,140
Jiaojiao is your sister

11
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,540
Not your enemy

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,100
Do you have to target her like this?

13
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,760
Is this the generation gap?

14
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,380
I really can’t communicate with my grandparents.

15
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:36,800
Mr. Mrs.

16
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,600
The family will send someone to pick up the young lady

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,440
Goodbye, grandpa. Goodbye, uncle.

18
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,040
Yoyo will miss you

19
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:45,240
Goodbye, my beautiful brother too

20
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,540
You are fine at home

21
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,340
Yoyo will come to play with you next time

22
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,160
Yoyo, is the food at uncle’s house delicious?

23
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,270
Oops, I will be confused tomorrow too

24
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:01,270
Our family wants to hire a chef from a Michelin restaurant to make desserts

25
00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:04,670
Yoyo, would you like to come and try it?

26
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:07,270
Okay, that's a deal, let's hook up

27
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:11,690
Hook and hang your husband

28
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:13,690
You trick a kid like this

29
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,580
Is it really okay? I can’t help it.

30
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:17,780
for son

31
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:19,580
I have no choice but to show off my old face.
